OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect released under
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder suspect has been released
OL,7,Funder investigation as police inquiries
OL,8,Fcontinue into the death of a man in
OL,9,FBroadstairs.
OL,11,FThe 61-year-old man, who was from the
OL,12,Farea, was arrested on suspicion of
OL,13,Fmurder after a man died at Ranelagh
OL,14,FGrove, in St Peter's, on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe man, who was in his 30s, was found
OL,17,Fby officers after police received a
OL,18,Freport of "concern" for a person
OL,19,Fshortly after 07:30 BST. His next of
OL,20,Fkin has been informed.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
